WEBVTT

00:10:59.329 --> 00:11:01.996
Should I radically reinvasion
my child's future?

00:11:02.246 --> 00:11:05.412
Of course, the answers are yes, yes, yes,
yes, yes.

00:11:05.412 --> 00:11:08.954
But, you know, the specifics
are really important.

00:11:08.954 --> 00:11:12.871
And so I've been thinking a lot
about some writing that I read

00:11:13.037 --> 00:11:19.537
a few years ago when I was zigzagging out
of my work with my congregation where

00:11:19.537 --> 00:11:22.412
I was deciding to stop doing
my congregational work.

00:11:22.954 --> 00:11:25.496
I read a couple of books by

00:11:25.537 --> 00:11:32.454
an academic named William Bridges
who studied life transition.